{#- Cover of article 05, drawn with the theme's colours. Decorative: the title
    sits next to it. On the left, the root key. It signs one list (the card
    in the middle, sealed in purple), and the list names each device on the
    right, each with a small key of its own. The fourth row is struck out and
    its device is only a dashed outline: removed from the list, unlinked.
    No transport colours: nothing here travels through a relay. The listed
    devices pulse only without reduced motion. -#}
